  A cut taken and unsigned is refused with the request and the account it waits on; a cut
  whose body has gaps names where they are read; a cut that was refused names its reason.
  --
  <b>THE RUN THAT RESOLVED THE SELECTION</b>
  Resolved from the report's selection: the report selected EOD, and the run resolved it to
  EOD.ACME-LONDON.2026-10-06. The run records the cut, so the result names its body even
  after the selection moves. The card names the cut, its timepoint, its basis and its parts.
